<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 20:38:57 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>六月满月</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0ddd821cff</link><description>&lt;p&gt;去年六月的满月&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a full moon shortly after nightfall, it's yellow/orange in color - someone's basketball hoop is in the foreground with a couple houses" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af0ddd821cff.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 20:38:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印第安纳步行者队启程</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0dd558a959</link><description>&lt;p&gt;前往印第安纳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='a toll plaza with 1960s neons that say "chicago skyway toll bridge" - it was taken right before sunrise' height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af0dd558a959.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 20:36:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>密歇根某地去年</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0dcca3561f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;去年在密歇根州的某个地方&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="some industrial tanks or buildings or something are painted in bright geometric designs next to a river" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af0dcca3561f.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 20:34:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Frost 🥶</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0d74d845da</link><description>&lt;p&gt;霜冻 🥶&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Frost on green grass in the early morning." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6af0d74d845da.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 20:10:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>恐怖图片分享</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0d0401a783</link><description>&lt;p&gt;还有一张那天的照片——刷屏了，因为我想给https://horror.some.pics稍微填充一下内容😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a view of the interstate and the skyline is visible above trees and buildings" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af0d0401a783.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:40:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>堵车时拍的照片</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0cfa5d2aa7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;又一张几个月前我堵车停下时拍的&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="an american airlines plane coming in to land - the sky is mostly cloudy" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af0cfa5d2aa7.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:38:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>安静的星期日</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0cc628cc24</link><description>&lt;p&gt;#静默星期天&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A two-lane road that passes under a bridge. The sun is setting, and the bridge and the trees lining the road stand out as black silhouettes against a yellow sky on the horizon. " height="2096" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6af0cc628cc24.jpg" width="2741"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:24:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>伪装成猫的雨云</title><link>https://some.pics/6af0be637a423</link><description>&lt;p&gt;发现一朵伪装成猫咪的雨云！🌧️&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A fluffy white cat relaxing in a window. " height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/azaleah/6af0be637a423.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://azaleah.some.pics"&gt;@azaleah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 18:24:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>秋叶终于红了</title><link>https://some.pics/6af09e725e5d1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;去年一场风暴在我还没来得及看叶子变红之前就把它们刮落了，很高兴这次赶上了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a large tree in red, orange, and green in the background over a dark gray roof" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af09e725e5d1.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 16:08:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>圣诞水果蛋糕面糊</title><link>https://some.pics/6af09d0c96a9e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;含有所有水果的圣诞蛋糕面糊。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Christmas cake batter with all the fruits. " height="2500" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/fran/6af09d0c96a9e.png" width="1875"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://fran.some.pics"&gt;@fran&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 16:02:38 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>